{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24684","headline":"斋居春久感事遣怀 · 白居易","name":"斋居春久感事遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斋戒坐三旬，笙歌发四邻。\n月明停酒夜，眼闇看花人。\n赖学空爲观，深知念是尘。\n犹思闲语笑，未忘旧交亲。\n久作龙门主，多爲兔苑宾。\n水嬉歌尽日，雪宴烛通晨。\n事事皆过分，时时自问身。\n风光抛得也，七十四年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}